--- !u!114 &6338698826100518183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6338698826100518176}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6167abe11af5db04699d0a9919475a24, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NONE: 0
  YES: 1
  CANCEL: 2
  NEXT: 3
  result: 0
  cancelButton: {fileID: 0}
  nextButton: {fileID: 0}
  tipText: {fileID: 5191495788074787651}
  headerText: {fileID: 1385486159}
  tipsList:
  - tipId: 0
    tip: swipe up or down on the right side of the screen to change options
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: create an account by filling in email address, a username, password and
      clicking 'create user'
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: login to an existing account by filling in ONLY  username and password and
      clicking 'login'
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: 'if you want to submit a score to the server, you must be logged in. you
      can go to ''Account'' and click login and login as a guest '
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: to update the game, go to 'Links' to find links to the latest builds
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: when playing 3/4/All point contest modes, you must shoot from the Xs on
      the ground
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: you receive experience multipliers by turning on hardcore, traffic, enemies,
      and sniper options
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: 'regular attack | standalone : hold block + press shoot | mobile : hold
      block + press bottom right screen '
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: player health + block + special regenerates slowly when enemies enabled
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: intial player health = 100, player block = 25
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: enemy minions health = 50, enemy bosses = 150. killing a boss is worth 3x
      experience
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: there is a nude code in the game
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: 'Pause screen | standalone : Escape/pause button | mobile : swipe down on
      right side of screen'
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: you can level up your player in Free Play mode. Arcade mode gives you max
      stats but no experience
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: luck is the percent chance you have of rolling a critical which removes
      all modifers from your shot except range or dodge an enemy attack or sniper
      shot
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: you gain 5 ft of range per level up. range is the only stat that can be
      leveled up indefintiely
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: the higher the jump stat, the slower the shot meter goes and vice versa
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: in 'Stats' page, hardcore, traffic, enemies, and sniper are serach filters
      for high scores
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: Sniper randonly shoots every 0-4 seconds. there is a 0.4 second delay between
      the shot sound and projectile arrival
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: on 3/4/All point contest modes, bonus points = remaining seconds after all
      shots completed divided by 2
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: if you remove a local account, you can add it back by going to 'Acount'
      and entering only username and password and clicking 'login'
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: for bug reports or any idea suggestions, on the 'links' screen there is
      option to send a report
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: Consecutive Shots game mode will not end on the timer if you have made 3+
      consecutive and you can continue until you miss
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: you cant attack an enemy or block if you have the basketball. you can use
      a special attack
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: luck is maxed out at 10
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: you can view the dev server online from the 'Links' screen
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: in 3/4/all point contest, the last shot of each X is a moneyball and its
      point value is doubled
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: with enemies enabled, the player's special attack takes 4 seconds to regenerate
      after use
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: on win/macOs, press shift +3 to turn on max stats. android, go to pause
      screen (swipe down on right side of screen) and double clock 'max stats' button
    tipRead: 0
  - tipId: 0
    tip: on easy diffculty, you receive max stats but half experience. normal diff
      is current level stats + full experience
    tipRead: 0
